Package: IntegraPBPKengine
Type: Package
Title: R Interface for INTEGRA PBPK Modeling
Version: 0.6.1
Authors@R: person("Achilleas", "Karakoltzidis",
    email = "achillek@cheng.auth.gr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a unified R interface for physiologically based
    pharmacokinetic modeling across supported chemicals. Functions support
    simulation, model and parameter exploration, study results,
    sensitivity and uncertainty analysis, and exposure reconstruction.
    Numerical calculations require a configured INTEGRA service.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: curl, graphics, grid, jsonlite, png, tibble, utils
NeedsCompilation: no
